This package connects to GitHub's official hosted service. No upstream server
executable, Docker image or extra runtime is bundled. The reviewed revision
records the integration source; it does not pin the hosted implementation.
The reviewed hosted service does not advertise OAuth for non-Copilot clients;
this integration uses the documented personal-access-token path.
